        <mxCell id="cicd_steps" value="&lt;b&gt;.github/workflows/build-and-release.yml&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#CBD5E1&quot;&gt;1. Trigger: On push / pull request to &lt;b&gt;main&lt;/b&gt; branch&lt;br&gt;2. Environment Setup: Ubuntu Runner + JDK 17 (Eclipse Temurin) + Android SDK 34&lt;br&gt;3. Build Tool: Gradle 8.11 Daemon Execution (./gradlew assembleRelease / assembleDebug)&lt;br&gt;4. Security &amp; Code Analysis: KSP Room Schema verification &amp; lint checks&lt;br&gt;5. Automated Packaging: Signed binary output: &lt;b&gt;RoadSafe-AI.apk&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;6. Artifact Distribution: Pushes direct download link to GitHub Releases &amp; Admin Web Portal&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#15803D;fontColor=#F0FDF4;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="cicd_group">
